Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["LocalStabilityMutation", "ObjectName",
 CellID->252921904,ExpressionUUID->"cdc47ae9-1e70-b14f-a0cd-f3f8b92027f1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"d347d03b-5b25-ed44-8459-4a4e8536908b"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["LocalStabilityMutation",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->
     "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
LocalStabilityMutation"], 
   RowBox[{"[", "rule", "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3efe3e62-3b88-3545-aa3d-fb3006d51c10"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "proposes a local-stability mutation of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["rule", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "db253667-4466-3b49-97d1-d0ea0a18a625"],
 "."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->705776315,ExpressionUUID->"ef720855-1a80-4e4e-9617-9f3c58fc7f97"],

Cell["\<\
This is catalog strategy 10, \"LocalStability\", of the approved 15-strategy \
mutation catalog.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->631627319,ExpressionUUID->"95c2b941-4f71-ac4f-950e-1e7f77d6c57a"],

Cell["\<\
Operators: PreserveMotif (keep a consumed left-hand edge on the right-hand \
side) and AddStableSubstructure (require a new edge over left-hand variables \
and rewrite it unchanged).\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->189536531,ExpressionUUID->"20693646-38bd-be4d-a549-989d1229823f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The strategy is opt-in: select it with \"MutationStrategies\" -> \
{\"LocalStability\"} in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
   "StructureAdaptiveEvolution", 
    "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
StructureAdaptiveEvolution", 
    "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/SamuelFrerichs/\
StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/StructureAdaptiveEvolution.html"},
   "TextRefLink",
   DisplayFunction->(TagBox[
     ButtonBox[
      StyleBox[#, ShowStringCharacters -> True, FontFamily -> 
       "Source Sans Pro"], 
      BaseStyle -> {"Link", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.02, 0.286, 0.651], 
          RGBColor[0.2823, 0.6666, 0.949]]}, ButtonData -> #2, ContentPadding -> 
      False], 
     MouseAppearanceTag["LinkHand"]]& )]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e6328123-c939-0c49-9f7b-772b118a3e38"],
 ", or with \"Goal\" -> \"LocalStability\", whose preset also promotes the \
catalog's primary objectives for the strategy to Pareto objectives."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->776212526,ExpressionUUID->"3815d3cc-1cf1-2847-a2d5-7320f2cb8229"],

Cell["\<\
Mutations are random. The result is a canonically new rule (or rule set), an \
Association with \"Rule\" and \"Details\", or a Failure when no valid new \
proposal exists. Inside a search, every operator that ran is recorded in the \
candidate's provenance.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->926302509,ExpressionUUID->"598b3842-5b2e-624f-bfb4-18c7c54c70fc"]
}, Open  ]],

